        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an asynchronous auto chess game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute little animals fight with each other, dozens of cute characters, 60+ basic cards, 60+  abilities, constantly build to bring out your endless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the rouge-lite mode still unfinished? Don't worry, your final deck will be saved permanently in the Champion Hall of Fame, becoming a unique and instantly playable deck that you created yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet's ultimate combat power depends entirely on strategy and operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcase your Hall of Fame deck, challenge advanced players on the leaderboard, and share it with friends for championship battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous online battle, play anytime and anywhere, no need to worry about the countdown, it's easy and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic rules are simple and clear, and after getting started, you will constantly feel the depth of it. It's fun and durable!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an asynchronous auto chess game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute little animals fight with each other, dozens of cute characters, 60+ basic cards, 60+  abilities, constantly build to bring out your endless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the rouge-lite mode still unfinished? Don't worry, your final deck will be saved permanently in the Champion Hall of Fame, becoming a unique and instantly playable deck that you created yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet's ultimate combat power depends entirely on strategy and operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcase your Hall of Fame deck, challenge advanced players on the leaderboard, and share it with friends for championship battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous online battle, play anytime and anywhere, no need to worry about the countdown, it's easy and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic rules are simple and clear, and after getting started, you will constantly feel the depth of it. It's fun and durable!</p>",
        "short_description": "Cute little animals are beating each other up! Hundreds of creative cards, thousands of strange fighting schools! No more one time's rouge-lite game! Permanently store the deck in the Hall of Champions! Send your deck to defeat your enemies anytime and anywhere!",
